BEGIN:VEVENT
ORGANIZER;CN="CSSZ":mailto:info@cssz.ch
SUMMARY:Goldau-Unterägeri Hike
DESCRIPTION:<strong>Event details:</strong> https://cssz.ch/events/goldau-hike/\n<strong>Location:</strong> <a href="https://en.mapy.cz/s/mumenunema" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Route</a>\n<strong>Coordinator:</strong> Radim Urban (<a class="link" href="mailto:radim.urban@cssz.ch" target="_blank" rel="noopener">radim.urban@cssz.ch</a>)\n<strong>Registration:</strong> <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeOCLtB4infagcGayZErxCqL7-doxOUA4sMS0QsbPJr56mLEQ/viewform" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Form</a>\n\n<h2 id="invitation">Invitation</h2> <p>CSSZ invites you and your friends to join a semester hike from <em>Goldau-Unterägeri</em>, which is planned for Saturday, 06.05.2023. Come and enjoy hiking in the beautiful nature with our society!</p> <h2 id="difficulty">Difficulty</h2> <p>Easy to sporty - about 1000m up and 850m down - but 15.6km, so nothing terrible.</p> <h2 id="transport-connection">Transport connection</h2> <p>We&rsquo;ll take a direct train to Goldau:</p> <picture class="img" style="background: url(data:image/jpeg;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAABQAAAADCAIAAAAcOLh5AAAAXUlEQVR4nIzKQQ4CIQxGYaZDm8iCBfe/ll6DBKr8pFRdsTNxvu17sdbKzAB8rU8IpRRmDtdQzvk86TXe8XG/PfuYs7fm7gBU1cz2&#43;cOhqiJiZhM4iFJKIrLrH98BAE57KyuNVczCAAAAAElFTkSuQmCC); background-size: cover; display: inline;">             <source srcset='/images/events/2023-05-06-goldau-hike/conn_hu_59175f8e1946036a.webp 1948w, /images/events/2023-05-06-goldau-hike/conn_hu_59175f8e1946036a.webp 1948w, /images/events/2023-05-06-goldau-hike/conn_hu_3f664cfdc1407f5f.webp 640w, /images/events/2023-05-06-goldau-hike/conn_hu_b1d1ced979023999.webp 1024w, /images/events/2023-05-06-goldau-hike/conn_hu_1c11622c8222b916.webp 1600w'                     sizes="(max-width: 1948px) 100vw, 1948px"                     type="image/webp"             /><source srcset='/images/events/2023-05-06-goldau-hike/conn_hu_c1163def28637d5a.jpg 1948w, /images/events/2023-05-06-goldau-hike/conn_hu_c1163def28637d5a.jpg 1948w, /images/events/2023-05-06-goldau-hike/conn_hu_aeeb525188345ac8.jpg 640w, /images/events/2023-05-06-goldau-hike/conn_hu_12a68d6a237d22ef.jpg 1024w, /images/events/2023-05-06-goldau-hike/conn_hu_d7e56832fa10810a.jpg 1600w'                     sizes="(max-width: 1948px) 100vw, 1948px"                     type="image/jpeg"             /><img src="/images/events/2023-05-06-goldau-hike/conn_hu_c1163def28637d5a.jpg"                  width="1948"                  height="318"                                                                                     /></picture> <p>And we&rsquo;ll take a bus and train on the way back from Unterägeri (ca. 1:15, one transfer)</p>
